    "notes": {
        "d60ea780-7170-4ba9-b9db-a3e2f028fec1": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 640,
            "width": 900,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n`WatchLocation` has no parent-path property — it watches an **entire drive** — and the cleanup\ndeletes whatever item id the trigger reports. This flow therefore deliberately uses the empty\n**Documents** library of the **TestSite1** SharePoint site, not the shared Stg Appmixer QA library\nthe other SharePoint E2E flows use.\n\nThe upload target folder `E2E-WatchLocation` must exist in that library — create it with\n`appmixer.microsoft.sharepoint.CreateFolder` on a fresh tenant.\n\nNothing else may write to that library while the flow runs, or the cleanup will delete a foreign\nfile. `Wait 1m` lets the Graph subscription propagate — do not remove it.\n\nThe account needs `Files.Read.All`, `Sites.Read.All` (trigger), `Files.ReadWrite.All` (upload)\nand `Sites.ReadWrite.All` (cleanup Make API Call)."
        }
